@startuml 인증_로그인_재발급

autonumber

actor User as U
participant FlutterApp as F
participant "AuthController\n(Flask API)" as AC
participant "UserService" as US
database DB

U -> F: 로그인 제출
F -> AC: POST /api/v1/auth/login {username, password}
AC -> US: login_user(username, password)
alt 성공
  US -> DB: SELECT user by username
  DB --> US: user + password_hash
  US --> AC: user, generate JWT(access, refresh)
  AC --> F: 200 {access_token, refresh_token}
  F --> U: 로그인 성공
else 실패
  US --> AC: None
  AC --> F: 401 Unauthorized
  F --> U: 오류 안내
end

== 토큰 재발급 ==
... access 만료 후 ...
F -> AC: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh {refresh_token}
AC -> US: verify_refresh(refresh_token)
alt 유효
  US --> AC: ok → new access_token
  AC --> F: 200 {access_token}
else 무효
  US --> AC: invalid
  AC --> F: 401 invalid refresh
end

@enduml


